sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant App
    participant Billing
    participant Provider
    participant DB

    Admin->>App: Selects plan or module
    App->>Billing: Creates payment session
    Billing->>Provider: Requests checkout session
    Provider-->>Billing: Returns session reference
    Billing-->>App: Sends redirect or client secret
    Provider-->>Billing: Sends verified webhook
    Billing->>DB: Updates invoice and entitlement
    App-->>Admin: Shows payment status
